resets to Skills, that's a bug (re-tapping the current main tab shouldn't change sub-tab). The change \"selected tab tracked by the profile screen itself\" might have this side effect. Let's test.\n\nCurrently Combat Gear. Go Profile (34), then Pets (13), then tap Profile bottom (43) while on Pets. Observe. This is a quick test.\n\nActually, we already tapped Profile while on Profile Skills and nothing changed. But on Pets, a re-tap might trigger the same \"screen re-created\" reset. Let's test.\n\nTap Profile (34) → (opens Skills). Then Pets (13). Then tap Profile (43)."}
